\n                    .getRole()).isEqualTo(BeanDefinition.ROLE_INFRASTRUCTURE);\n            assertThat(context.getBeanFactory()\n                    .getBeanDefinition(TaskManagementConfigUtils.ASYNC_EXECUTION_ASPECT_BEAN_NAME)\n                    .getRole()).isEqualTo(BeanDefinition.ROLE_INFRASTRUCTURE);\n        }\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    void transactionAspectAcceptsPublicTransactionConfiguration() {\n"}, {"oldText": "    @Configurable(\"configurableService\")\n    public static class ConfigurableService {\n", "newText": "    private AnnotationConfigApplicationContext openAspectJContext(Class<?> configurationClass) {\n        AnnotationConfigApplicationContext context = new AnnotationConfigApplicationContext();\n        context.removeBeanDefinition(AnnotationConfigUtils.CONFIGURATION_ANNOTATION_PROCESSOR_BEAN_NAME);\n        context.addBeanFactoryPostProcessor(new NativeCompatibleConfigurationClassPostProcessor());\n        context.register(configurationClass);\n        context.refresh();\n        return context;\n    }\n\n    @EnableSpringConfigured\n    @Configuration(proxyBeanMethods = false)\n    static class SpringConfiguredTestConfiguration {\n    }\n\n    @EnableAsync(mode = AdviceMode.ASPECTJ)\n    @EnableCaching(mode = AdviceMode.ASPECTJ)\n    @EnableTransactionManagement(mode = AdviceMode.ASPECTJ)\n    @Configuration(proxyBeanMethods = false)\n    static class AspectJInfrastructureConfiguration {\n        @Bean\n        CacheManager cacheManager() {\n            return new ConcurrentMapCacheManager(\"books\");\n        }\n\n        @Bean\n        PlatformTransactionManager transactionManager() {\n            return new RecordingTransactionManager();\n        }\n\n        @Bean\n        Executor taskExecutor() {\n            return new SyncTaskExecutor();\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class NativeCompatibleConfigurationClassPostProcessor extends ConfigurationClassPostProcessor {\n        @Override\n        public void enhanceConfigurationClasses(DefaultListableBeanFactory beanFactory) {\n        }\n    }\n\n    @Configurable(\"configurableService\")\n    public static class ConfigurableService {\n"}]}}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 1274, "output": 2014, "cacheRead": 54144, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 582, "totalTokens": 57432, "cost": {"input": 0.005096, "output": 0.04028, "cacheRead": 0.021657600000000003, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0670336}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1790484711941, "responseId": "resp_0f36969c08853ffe016ab8a0e81a6087d2b29b31105e4299db", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": [{"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_KK41whQ621OGRyjoP8x67w9J|fc_0f36969c08853ffe016ab8a0f3bfdc87d2b302d249767c9db1", "toolName": "edit", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Successfully replaced 4 block(s) in tests/src/org.springframework/spring-aspects/5.3.31/src/test/java/org_springframework/spring_aspects/Spring_aspectsTest.java."}], "details": {"diff": "     ...\n  15 import org.springframework.beans.factory.config.BeanDefinition;\n  16 import org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionBuilder;\n  17 import org.springframework.beans.factory.support.DefaultListableBeanFactory;\n  18 import org.springframework.cache.Cache;\n+ 19 import org.springframework.cache.CacheManager;\n+ 20 import org.springframework.cache.annotation.EnableCaching;\n  19 import org.springframework.cache.aspectj.AnnotationCacheAspect;\n  20 import org.springframework.cache.concurrent.ConcurrentMapCacheManager;\n+ 23 import org.springframework.cache.config.CacheManagementConfigUtils;\n+ 24 import org.springframework.context.annotation.AdviceMode;\n+ 25 import org.springframework.context.annotation.AnnotationConfigApplicationContext;\n+ 26 import org.springframework.context.annotation.AnnotationConfigUtils;\n+ 27 import org.springframework.context.annotation.Bean;\n+ 28 import org.springframework.context.annotation.Configuration